{"id": "B-000001", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Introduction"], "lines": [2, 2], "text": "The `lice` project is designed to streamline the creation of license files for software projects. By automating the retrieval and formatting of various open-source licenses, `lice` makes it easier for developers to comply with legal requirements and openly share their code with the appropriate licensing.", "text_hash": "sha256:12d7add1f86c1749e844708a9120a8e29e8b988dca20c6d75a2596fdf5f16807", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:12d7add1f86c1749e844708a9120a8e29e8b988dca20c6d75a2596fdf5f16807"}
{"id": "B-000002", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Goals"], "lines": [5, 5], "text": "The goal of the `lice` project is to provide a tool that quickly generates license files for software projects, supporting a wide range of commonly used open-source licenses. It aims to save time for developers and help ensure that software licensing is handled correctly and efficiently.", "text_hash": "sha256:ea3d9cb02b8491565df39bab0eee8f7ffb2fadf8aa182e42324866767d9cfe07", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:ea3d9cb02b8491565df39bab0eee8f7ffb2fadf8aa182e42324866767d9cfe07"}
{"id": "B-000003", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [8, 8], "text": "`lice` offers the following features and functionalities:", "text_hash": "sha256:7a9b4eca32ea9dccb1bd5a6713bbad9301792c0059470ee0b59ce95e06533977", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:7a9b4eca32ea9dccb1bd5a6713bbad9301792c0059470ee0b59ce95e06533977"}
{"id": "B-000004", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [9, 9], "text": "- License Generation: Users can generate various licenses such as BSD-3, MIT, GPL, etc., with simple commands.", "text_hash": "sha256:ac6243afca84e8ff8dbf005ba48a2f717527ad1c080a29a098ff329f53d84243", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:ac6243afca84e8ff8dbf005ba48a2f717527ad1c080a29a098ff329f53d84243"}
{"id": "B-000005", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [10, 10], "text": "- Customization: Allows specification of the year and organization for the generated license.", "text_hash": "sha256:9eba90fe3955ced7072ecb17879237e4343200f723533fe5b76dab07fe0075f1", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:9eba90fe3955ced7072ecb17879237e4343200f723533fe5b76dab07fe0075f1"}
{"id": "B-000006", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [11, 11], "text": "- Integration: Tries to use `git config` or the `$USER` environment variable if the organization is not specified.", "text_hash": "sha256:0b4a9c64a104134a99139a40e3e6c33b97a77484741c93c8961159b3373899dd", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:0b4a9c64a104134a99139a40e3e6c33b97a77484741c93c8961159b3373899dd"}
{"id": "B-000007", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [12, 12], "text": "- Formatting: Supports the creation of license headers for source files in different programming languages.", "text_hash": "sha256:f0983d6053d6ee2f4757dca3f348cb8810b3aac73dbfa36608731ac948f05599", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:f0983d6053d6ee2f4757dca3f348cb8810b3aac73dbfa36608731ac948f05599"}
{"id": "B-000008", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [13, 13], "text": "- File Creation: Can generate a new source file with the license commented in the header.", "text_hash": "sha256:12bf3e08986c09922874e747f5d00c3b9c8f1e101b579e361cb52cc50e2ff72d", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:12bf3e08986c09922874e747f5d00c3b9c8f1e101b579e361cb52cc50e2ff72d"}
{"id": "B-000009", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [14, 14], "text": "- Language Detection: Automatically detects the language for file formatting based on the file extension provided.", "text_hash": "sha256:649601c756dac33f2d751c83273f179ee4eec7f0a1376f990610db7ed5691bb1", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:649601c756dac33f2d751c83273f179ee4eec7f0a1376f990610db7ed5691bb1"}
{"id": "B-000010", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [15, 15], "text": "- Extensibility: Users can contribute by adding support for additional licenses or programming languages.", "text_hash": "sha256:888fb1b241755cdd21f38b2828db084449c16a856f3f87a84be7364c88f2b57e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:888fb1b241755cdd21f38b2828db084449c16a856f3f87a84be7364c88f2b57e"}
{"id": "B-000011", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [18, 18], "text": "The `lice` project, aimed at automating the creation of license files for software projects, uses a set of 35 templates stored in the `templates` folder. This collection is essential for testing and validating the software's functionality in generating a variety of open-source licenses:", "text_hash": "sha256:4ca80268a3cd4d9848af53205d5b4b8720b2d2e47d2d2bd8125b19afc614cd55", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:4ca80268a3cd4d9848af53205d5b4b8720b2d2e47d2d2bd8125b19afc614cd55"}
{"id": "B-000012", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [20, 20], "text": "**`./templates` Folder:**", "text_hash": "sha256:43f3dcc3a2befa7fd9b90b5f3a931e9e87a065e5cf9f705e3343b4b9f914040d", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:43f3dcc3a2befa7fd9b90b5f3a931e9e87a065e5cf9f705e3343b4b9f914040d"}
{"id": "B-000013", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [22, 22], "text": "- **License Templates:**", "text_hash": "sha256:27b0699b925d007b6a2714d0c77835dadb1d119cd457c883e0bf660ccad7a19e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:27b0699b925d007b6a2714d0c77835dadb1d119cd457c883e0bf660ccad7a19e"}
{"id": "B-000014", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [23, 23], "text": "  - Includes a wide range of license templates, such as `template-afl3.txt`, `template-agpl3.txt`, `template-apache.txt`, `template-bsd2.txt`, `template-cc_by.txt`, and many others.", "text_hash": "sha256:71c7bedeaef2dfe47b532019c1dc543ea6a7046d1e4192e16db91fd9e65d855e", "parent_block": "B-000013", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:71c7bedeaef2dfe47b532019c1dc543ea6a7046d1e4192e16db91fd9e65d855e"}
{"id": "B-000015", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [24, 24], "text": "  - Each template corresponds to a different type of open-source license, covering common licenses like Apache, GPL, MIT, BSD, and Creative Commons variants.", "text_hash": "sha256:ed20d26c8e7762372fe3fa4d9ae89ea8f571b34da89beec5fc9a93c678b17e53", "parent_block": "B-000013", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:ed20d26c8e7762372fe3fa4d9ae89ea8f571b34da89beec5fc9a93c678b17e53"}
{"id": "B-000016", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [26, 26], "text": "- **Header Templates:**", "text_hash": "sha256:cb1b06c75ff86745345f2be2530a915ff7561f58f309226bdc3b9d0026328007", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:cb1b06c75ff86745345f2be2530a915ff7561f58f309226bdc3b9d0026328007"}
{"id": "B-000017", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [27, 27], "text": "  - Contains header templates like `template-agpl3-header.txt`, `template-apache-header.txt`, `template-cc_by-header.txt`, and more.", "text_hash": "sha256:103864ebee1f3ce81b0b2b2393513ccb6642b0df6467a5ab36340be961e580ee", "parent_block": "B-000016", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:103864ebee1f3ce81b0b2b2393513ccb6642b0df6467a5ab36340be961e580ee"}
{"id": "B-000018", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [28, 28], "text": "  - These templates are designed to insert license information into the headers of source files, catering to different programming languages and file types.", "text_hash": "sha256:6e6389b0fc3008ed6826f7eabf262833e75322506b7fa13ec229554541d8b4a1", "parent_block": "B-000016", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:6e6389b0fc3008ed6826f7eabf262833e75322506b7fa13ec229554541d8b4a1"}
{"id": "B-000019", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Supporting Data Description"], "lines": [30, 30], "text": "The comprehensive range of templates in the `./templates` folder allows the `lice` tool to generate license files tailored to a variety of licensing requirements, ensuring legal compliance and facilitating open-source sharing. This functionality aligns with the project's goals of simplifying license file creation and integrating seamlessly into software development workflows.", "text_hash": "sha256:f162e606d7a66bbd06f5ad5d37dae5c92f36e4fb038be29609082b171c6541a4", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:f162e606d7a66bbd06f5ad5d37dae5c92f36e4fb038be29609082b171c6541a4"}
{"id": "B-000020", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Constraints"], "lines": [33, 33], "text": "- The project should be intuitive enough for developers who are not familiar with legal terminologies of software licenses.", "text_hash": "sha256:84b3e4edf726b35c79bc9ee20823dfb2b508b493457388c624841e1a72346447", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:84b3e4edf726b35c79bc9ee20823dfb2b508b493457388c624841e1a72346447"}
{"id": "B-000021", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Constraints"], "lines": [34, 34], "text": "- It should be easily integrated into existing workflows or development environments.", "text_hash": "sha256:cf80de2367639926e2f8742a96e5eeb7f7fe99ee508acc7e9e76c9f0351807a5", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:cf80de2367639926e2f8742a96e5eeb7f7fe99ee508acc7e9e76c9f0351807a5"}
{"id": "B-000022", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Technical Constraints"], "lines": [37, 37], "text": "- The project is implemented in Python, so it should be maintainable and follow Pythonic conventions.", "text_hash": "sha256:923ea0ebefaa95f4e15c8d5c987da28fee94331d8ba2019b0370142601adff81", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:923ea0ebefaa95f4e15c8d5c987da28fee94331d8ba2019b0370142601adff81"}
{"id": "B-000023", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Technical Constraints"], "lines": [38, 38], "text": "- It should support cross-platform compatibility across different operating systems.", "text_hash": "sha256:b7d957cde34a0e3de9947b5adb3304f3c8fb3ad8b953a498c2ad7b9418a8a8f5", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:b7d957cde34a0e3de9947b5adb3304f3c8fb3ad8b953a498c2ad7b9418a8a8f5"}
{"id": "B-000024", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Use Cases"], "lines": [41, 41], "text": "- A developer initializing a new project repository who needs to quickly add a license file.", "text_hash": "sha256:1f3d54e3603be238c8219dbc849e579cf5bdbca7721ef00e16252ce2c0344634", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1f3d54e3603be238c8219dbc849e579cf5bdbca7721ef00e16252ce2c0344634"}
{"id": "B-000025", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Use Cases"], "lines": [42, 42], "text": "- An open-source contributor who wants to change the license of their project.", "text_hash": "sha256:5d4e5e6000b86c24e1f45204cfb6b49fa12299840145086d6f41f8a1a71a349f", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:5d4e5e6000b86c24e1f45204cfb6b49fa12299840145086d6f41f8a1a71a349f"}
{"id": "B-000026", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Requirements", "Dependencies"], "lines": [46, 46], "text": "- pytest library", "text_hash": "sha256:3e549fe96a119368d3ff2662628f8989687efa5edf39d310b0b4230874f4e9f6", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:3e549fe96a119368d3ff2662628f8989687efa5edf39d310b0b4230874f4e9f6"}
{"id": "B-000027", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Requirements", "Dependencies"], "lines": [47, 47], "text": "- flake8 library", "text_hash": "sha256:86478712c5369909aeea776c9acd340e9fd7ba4c6690b13d296cd374d0ae8766", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:86478712c5369909aeea776c9acd340e9fd7ba4c6690b13d296cd374d0ae8766"}
{"id": "B-000028", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Usage"], "lines": [50, 68], "text": "```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Generate a BSD3 license using default options\npython lice/core.py bsd3\n\n# Generate an MIT license using default options\npython lice/core.py mit\n\n# Generate a GPL3 license for the year 2021 and organization 'ExampleOrg'\npython lice/core.py gpl3 --year 2021 --org 'ExampleOrg'\n\n# Generate an Apache license with a header formatted for a Python source file\npython lice/core.py apache --header --language py\n\n# Generate a BSD2 license and save it to a file named 'LICENSE'\npython lice/core.py bsd2 --file LICENSE\n\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:930398311d246f347842c742b5d040320b218611b7cdc345e2b4258787d5ff3f", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:930398311d246f347842c742b5d040320b218611b7cdc345e2b4258787d5ff3f"}
{"id": "B-000029", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Usage", "Command Line Configuration Arguments"], "lines": [73, 73], "text": "The following are the command line arguments that users can specify with `lice`:", "text_hash": "sha256:822d0932ccb9c93cd8b6299980543a69c23dd4f3e1b3e09250f7f45e29f64331", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:822d0932ccb9c93cd8b6299980543a69c23dd4f3e1b3e09250f7f45e29f64331"}
{"id": "B-000030", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Usage", "Command Line Configuration Arguments"], "lines": [75, 75], "text": "- `license`: The type of license to generate.", "text_hash": "sha256:fdd6bdce81822369a7dee0257038a768eaec437001f8c24f2df62d589237c7b6", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:fdd6bdce81822369a7dee0257038a768eaec437001f8c24f2df62d589237c7b6"}
{"id": "B-000031", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Usage", "Command Line Configuration Arguments"], "lines": [76, 76], "text": "- `-o`, `--org ORGANIZATION`: The organization under which the license is registered.", "text_hash": "sha256:67d3f558e312fb5d5fe8a1638cf8e764665308340b5bb3494db96be85bbef129", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:67d3f558e312fb5d5fe8a1638cf8e764665308340b5bb3494db96be85bbef129"}
{"id": "B-000032", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Usage", "Command Line Configuration Arguments"], "lines": [77, 77], "text": "- `-p`, `--proj PROJECT`: The project name for which the license is generated.", "text_hash": "sha256:c2fbecba14586b20485c350f6f0621363f76bbbe55d50968f38bc2723854868f", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c2fbecba14586b20485c350f6f0621363f76bbbe55d50968f38bc2723854868f"}
{"id": "B-000033", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Usage", "Command Line Configuration Arguments"], "lines": [78, 78], "text": "- `-t`, `--template TEMPLATE_PATH`: The path to a custom license template file.", "text_hash": "sha256:4699b0cacc4f45e557b0df8cc03638d45cd3b638ca9469724280d64a9178fc71", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:4699b0cacc4f45e557b0df8cc03638d45cd3b638ca9469724280d64a9178fc71"}
