{"id": "B-000038", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [86, 86], "text": "To validate the correct implementation of the command-line interface:", "text_hash": "sha256:49db0659c51ef20c7064fc838ec5a45e718612bb5b70032213cfec30c0730d56", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:49db0659c51ef20c7064fc838ec5a45e718612bb5b70032213cfec30c0730d56"}
{"id": "B-000039", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [88, 88], "text": "- All commands must execute without errors when the correct syntax is used.", "text_hash": "sha256:7e81be2614aa2693e85f2df9f8d1161a21687723171daf7517ab2c11ca2de68d", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:7e81be2614aa2693e85f2df9f8d1161a21687723171daf7517ab2c11ca2de68d"}
{"id": "B-000040", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [89, 89], "text": "- The tool must correctly generate the license text for each specified license type.", "text_hash": "sha256:a8bf815dde39260506a345b8542dc925671e82a5f4b211375b91c9a948b37627", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a8bf815dde39260506a345b8542dc925671e82a5f4b211375b91c9a948b37627"}
{"id": "B-000041", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [90, 90], "text": "- Custom organization and project names must be accurately reflected in the generated license file.", "text_hash": "sha256:37f79b3fd7d58eceed56c2a0f2622bcf16353fe9a3b9650f6c1947f08259d62d", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:37f79b3fd7d58eceed56c2a0f2622bcf16353fe9a3b9650f6c1947f08259d62d"}
{"id": "B-000042", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [91, 91], "text": "- When a custom template path is provided, the license generated must match the custom template.", "text_hash": "sha256:7be2683497ad15093e8926cf034ff5e93a587dda2c7487a1fe00e5e62b4c0778", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:7be2683497ad15093e8926cf034ff5e93a587dda2c7487a1fe00e5e62b4c0778"}
{"id": "B-000043", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [92, 92], "text": "- The tool must accurately format licenses according to the specified programming language syntax.", "text_hash": "sha256:0e67ed73067f4ac1732f992f97396faf4c31a285c1b745be8fcb3854891b3748", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:0e67ed73067f4ac1732f992f97396faf4c31a285c1b745be8fcb3854891b3748"}
{"id": "B-000044", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Acceptance Criteria"], "lines": [93, 93], "text": "- The `--vars` option must list all the correct template variables for the specified license type.", "text_hash": "sha256:77436e1afe260575cf1c5838342396c5333959e567ad50aa517e8c6dd378c2a0", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:77436e1afe260575cf1c5838342396c5333959e567ad50aa517e8c6dd378c2a0"}
{"id": "B-000045", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Dependencies"], "lines": [97, 97], "text": "The `lice` tool relies on the following environment settings and external resources:", "text_hash": "sha256:4737b8bf13b1c3a273d9070ac2e104d4d980eb117e08b090c74b2b3af50887bf", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:4737b8bf13b1c3a273d9070ac2e104d4d980eb117e08b090c74b2b3af50887bf"}
{"id": "B-000046", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Dependencies"], "lines": [99, 99], "text": "- Python runtime environment.", "text_hash": "sha256:5c0ddabb6f7cd886b8c0b62e6e55306cf07b5c2254dcf4891f2c58d9b0a1c701", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:5c0ddabb6f7cd886b8c0b62e6e55306cf07b5c2254dcf4891f2c58d9b0a1c701"}
{"id": "B-000047", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Dependencies"], "lines": [100, 100], "text": "- Access to system environment variables or `git config` for default values.", "text_hash": "sha256:04c5d4c1669a9cf05914add6f0522bf34ae38214afbd9a36ad9d043faefe24de", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:04c5d4c1669a9cf05914add6f0522bf34ae38214afbd9a36ad9d043faefe24de"}
{"id": "B-000048", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Dependencies"], "lines": [101, 101], "text": "- Access to file system for reading custom templates and writing license files.", "text_hash": "sha256:6f13643990273e2db3ef8f5ab446dd823cc88218abea50fe48051274c9f471d8", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:6f13643990273e2db3ef8f5ab446dd823cc88218abea50fe48051274c9f471d8"}
{"id": "B-000049", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Terms/Concepts Explanation"], "lines": [105, 105], "text": "- **Command-line Interface (CLI)**: A text-based interface used to operate software by typing commands.", "text_hash": "sha256:5b568352e077aaaffc74c8facfb5a26a0efeac74c11c8a01d7eaea8ce887a4cb", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:5b568352e077aaaffc74c8facfb5a26a0efeac74c11c8a01d7eaea8ce887a4cb"}
{"id": "B-000050", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Terms/Concepts Explanation"], "lines": [106, 106], "text": "- **Template Variable**: A placeholder in the license template that is replaced with actual data when generating the license file.", "text_hash": "sha256:8e6fb239c7a892fbf604b8130364cb032e8800f5aa2474cffb3a34b1d6f1f09f", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:8e6fb239c7a892fbf604b8130364cb032e8800f5aa2474cffb3a34b1d6f1f09f"}
{"id": "B-000051", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_class.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML class"], "lines": [3, 54], "text": "```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n  class Global_functions {\n    +main()\n    +clean_path(p String) String\n    +get_context(args ArgumentParser) Context\n    +guess_organization() String\n    +load_file_template(path String) StringIO\n    +load_template(license String, header Boolean) StringIO\n    +extract_vars(template StringIO) List\n    +generate_license(template StringIO, context Context) StringIO\n    +format_license(template StringIO, lang String) StringIO\n    +get_suffix(name String) String | Boolean\n  }\n  Global_functions : Global_functions is a fake class to host global functions.\n\n  class Context{\n    -year String\n    -organization String\n    -project String\n  }\n\n  class ArgumentParser{\n    -_action_groups List\n    +add_argument()\n    +parse_args() ArgumentParser\n  }\n\n  class StringIO{\n    -buf Buffer\n    +write(str String)\n    +getvalue() String\n    +close()\n    +seek(index Integer)\n    +readlines() List\n  }\n\n  class LICENSES{\n    <<enumeration>>\n    AGPL3\n    Apache\n    BSD2\n    BSD3\n    ...\n  }\n\n  Global_functions --> LICENSES : uses >>\n  Global_functions --> Context : creates >>\n  Global_functions --> ArgumentParser : uses >>\n  Global_functions --> StringIO : uses >>\n\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:4903ca1b34ece3606c7ca9dbc66091ce8b743599e21470455f4273b8abb587c6", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:4903ca1b34ece3606c7ca9dbc66091ce8b743599e21470455f4273b8abb587c6"}
{"id": "B-000052", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_sequence.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML sequence"], "lines": [3, 35], "text": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant User\n  participant ArgumentParser\n  participant Global_functions\n  participant Context\n  participant StringIO\n\n  User->>Global_functions: main()\n  activate Global_functions\n\n  Global_functions->>ArgumentParser: parse_args()\n  activate ArgumentParser\n  ArgumentParser-->>Global_functions: args\n  deactivate ArgumentParser\n\n  Global_functions->>Global_functions: guess_organization()\n  Global_functions-->>Global_functions: org\n  Global_functions->>Global_functions: get_context(args)\n  Global_functions-->>Context: context\n  Global_functions->>Global_functions: load_template(license, header)\n  Global_functions-->>StringIO: template\n\n  Global_functions->>Global_functions: generate_license(template, context)\n  Global_functions-->>StringIO: content\n\n  Global_functions->>Global_functions: format_license(content, lang)\n  Global_functions-->>StringIO: formatted_license\n\n  Global_functions->>User: Display or write to file\n  deactivate Global_functions\n\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:789098976ad20ea0e0f20a8fcab0d6b1233ba125a7d5ed15da796bc0bffc0ec8", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:789098976ad20ea0e0f20a8fcab0d6b1233ba125a7d5ed15da796bc0bffc0ec8"}
{"id": "B-000053", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [3, 3], "text": "This document outlines the architecture design for the Lice License Generator project. The design is based on the functionality as specified in the `core.py` and `_init_.py` files, as well as the `examples.sh` script provided.", "text_hash": "sha256:c003d4be5a1dc14087aed336bfc3fb68e10bc7e15bf9358d1d72df280377d714", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c003d4be5a1dc14087aed336bfc3fb68e10bc7e15bf9358d1d72df280377d714"}
{"id": "B-000054", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [5, 5], "text": "Below is a text-based representation of the file tree for the Lice License Generator project.", "text_hash": "sha256:c169a57c6ee2e981b02e04f906bd0e68a907127c64bc69c553a0fbc78da05e9d", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c169a57c6ee2e981b02e04f906bd0e68a907127c64bc69c553a0fbc78da05e9d"}
{"id": "B-000055", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [7, 14], "text": "```plaintext\n├── .github\n├── lice\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   └── core.py\n└── examples\n    └── examples.sh\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:5162c6777619d6631fdfa81534accfc032871528c812b1fd714353b3b52afa52", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
{"id": "B-000056", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [16, 16], "text": "Examples:", "text_hash": "sha256:1889f03338b79bbad8bdcdc925ef5e83069569c17e433174ef9a49f62e7d5ee7", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1889f03338b79bbad8bdcdc925ef5e83069569c17e433174ef9a49f62e7d5ee7"}
{"id": "B-000057", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [17, 17], "text": "- To generate a license, run `./examples.sh` which encapsulates the commands to install Lice and generate various licenses.", "text_hash": "sha256:aaaef6df23a4b690c609839139eef6a806dfcde0029d3b68bc21122a8db50d07", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:aaaef6df23a4b690c609839139eef6a806dfcde0029d3b68bc21122a8db50d07"}
{"id": "B-000058", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [19, 19], "text": "- To run tests, the `examples.sh` script includes a command for discovering and running unit tests.", "text_hash": "sha256:50d2d64342e268bf0a97632d535870bf816c9dd5a07ef9a55a9e120e674ca02e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:50d2d64342e268bf0a97632d535870bf816c9dd5a07ef9a55a9e120e674ca02e"}
{"id": "B-000059", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [21, 38], "text": "  ```bash\n    #! /bin/bash\n    set -e\n    \n    # source /path/to/your/venv/bin/activate\n    pip install lice\n    \n    lice\n    \n    lice mit\n    \n    lice -y $(date +\"%Y\") -o \"Your Organization Name\"\n    \n    lice -l py > LICENSE.txt\n    \n    # Run tests\n    python -m unittest discover -s ./lice/tests -p 'test_*.py'\n  ```", "text_hash": "sha256:377c00840e726e21c774c5bd1b419b5b451213638b0ed4a623e7e7b7fdd1baa4", "parent_block": "B-000058", "parent_relation": "continuation", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:377c00840e726e21c774c5bd1b419b5b451213638b0ed4a623e7e7b7fdd1baa4"}
{"id": "B-000060", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [40, 40], "text": "`__init__.py`:", "text_hash": "sha256:eae8003dd96c3268e0bb344ca9f1faa82643c35408fc454432e8e59d6951adb3", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:eae8003dd96c3268e0bb344ca9f1faa82643c35408fc454432e8e59d6951adb3"}
{"id": "B-000061", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [41, 41], "text": "- Defines the version of the Lice package and the `main()` entry point for the CLI.", "text_hash": "sha256:23e5c07ddcf69dab1b163659897c129ef6eccf1045643d7410d7b115eaa1638e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:23e5c07ddcf69dab1b163659897c129ef6eccf1045643d7410d7b115eaa1638e"}
{"id": "B-000062", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [43, 43], "text": "`core.py`:", "text_hash": "sha256:23bc44c09c87afbc96ab00a874b82185c0912357ed8c18ac5858b95a9ef67ea1", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:23bc44c09c87afbc96ab00a874b82185c0912357ed8c18ac5858b95a9ef67ea1"}
{"id": "B-000063", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [44, 44], "text": "- Houses the main functionality of the Lice License Generator.", "text_hash": "sha256:377b38921570ad9d4ba08b707a5ac775588665dbd5283d179eb4582b97ce6c06", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:377b38921570ad9d4ba08b707a5ac775588665dbd5283d179eb4582b97ce6c06"}
{"id": "B-000064", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [45, 45], "text": "    - `main()`: Parses command-line arguments and invokes the appropriate functions to generate licenses.", "text_hash": "sha256:1ab12618f3a99c51cdadfbaa6d44b1022672a7fd4b15bf963112e9f2fdd0080f", "parent_block": "B-000063", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1ab12618f3a99c51cdadfbaa6d44b1022672a7fd4b15bf963112e9f2fdd0080f"}
{"id": "B-000065", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [46, 46], "text": "    - `guess_organization()`: Attempts to determine the user's organization from git config or the USER environment variable.", "text_hash": "sha256:131c054b6fedca5bec79296f5412ac700ce98767cb9133cace9121e081745586", "parent_block": "B-000063", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:131c054b6fedca5bec79296f5412ac700ce98767cb9133cace9121e081745586"}
{"id": "B-000066", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [47, 47], "text": "    - `generate_license()`: Generates the license text based on the selected template and context (year, organization, project).", "text_hash": "sha256:31f401546ebeff994fcd0717b48321decaa695c23979824cdb29ac02be3c5c6d", "parent_block": "B-000063", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:31f401546ebeff994fcd0717b48321decaa695c23979824cdb29ac02be3c5c6d"}
{"id": "B-000067", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [48, 48], "text": "    - `format_license()`: Formats the license text for a specific programming language comment style.", "text_hash": "sha256:e8763e616b2ca8cd8edcab74d8c60da552563a4005c69cff9e5829cf425232d6", "parent_block": "B-000063", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e8763e616b2ca8cd8edcab74d8c60da552563a4005c69cff9e5829cf425232d6"}
{"id": "B-000068", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [50, 50], "text": "Templates:", "text_hash": "sha256:1aaf0457467a68861a3ed3366d4bf4974e15dfb9739313a7c9226218c306fa67", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1aaf0457467a68861a3ed3366d4bf4974e15dfb9739313a7c9226218c306fa67"}
{"id": "B-000069", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [51, 51], "text": "- The `templates` directory contains the text templates for various licenses. Each license template can be used to generate the corresponding license file.", "text_hash": "sha256:aa76fb3df26c9f005f4a81cc71bf914cea44f34f744bb6b650d07e9f70075750", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:aa76fb3df26c9f005f4a81cc71bf914cea44f34f744bb6b650d07e9f70075750"}
{"id": "B-000070", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [53, 53], "text": "To generate a license:", "text_hash": "sha256:6ddc8a872c20d94d1f157e15eccd7c926141400e5f0cf914c0681d057a96377e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:6ddc8a872c20d94d1f157e15eccd7c926141400e5f0cf914c0681d057a96377e"}
{"id": "B-000071", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [54, 56], "text": "```bash\nlice [license_type] -o \"Your Organization Name\" -y $(date +\"%Y\")\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:dc18c622fae325b1f2c91f93b5d98d2e3b1e677f068f6373543ef3618f495415", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:dc18c622fae325b1f2c91f93b5d98d2e3b1e677f068f6373543ef3618f495415"}
{"id": "B-000072", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [58, 58], "text": "To format a license for a Python source file:", "text_hash": "sha256:8e48cbad843b3bb2cf6bfc4c0a3aa7bbc007bfc3d95c8eedc6293e82e7902e14", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:8e48cbad843b3bb2cf6bfc4c0a3aa7bbc007bfc3d95c8eedc6293e82e7902e14"}
{"id": "B-000073", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [59, 61], "text": "```bash\nlice -l py -f [filename]\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:4a19b36c63b62cecd86741ad0c9ba84d6531a43192bbe79cb529d07090063a4c", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:4a19b36c63b62cecd86741ad0c9ba84d6531a43192bbe79cb529d07090063a4c"}
{"id": "B-000074", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [63, 63], "text": "To run tests:", "text_hash": "sha256:bc52a8d34c6dddf7cc428e4b2e2f3aa78238553fad3084cacd851b46b2fcbaae", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:bc52a8d34c6dddf7cc428e4b2e2f3aa78238553fad3084cacd851b46b2fcbaae"}
{"id": "B-000075", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [64, 66], "text": "```bash\npython -m unittest discover -s ./lice/tests -p 'test_*.py'\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:c4a8257c00f64b4a229cb4d72a48eab2e0176068da44cf0f4d3b9aba0257bb17", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c4a8257c00f64b4a229cb4d72a48eab2e0176068da44cf0f4d3b9aba0257bb17"}
{"id": "B-000076", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [68, 68], "text": "The architecture is designed to be modular and extensible, allowing for the addition of new license templates and language comment styles as needed.", "text_hash": "sha256:185c0d9a38ecfe5db51652ba0a0b707e8039f63ed4013b3ee4943b25a3165395", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:185c0d9a38ecfe5db51652ba0a0b707e8039f63ed4013b3ee4943b25a3165395"}
